```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    package="com.madhub.tiktokautocommentsof">

    <!-- 
    Problem: To ensure the application operates smoothly and efficiently in an automated social media management context,
    it's crucial to request the necessary permissions that enhance functionality and user experience.
    This configuration addresses these challenges by declaring the permissions required for network access and storage.
    -->

    <!-- Permission for internet access -->
    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.INTERNET" />
    <!-- 
    This permission solves the problem of needing to connect to the internet to send and retrieve comments automatically.
    Without this, the app would be unable to perform its core functions effectively.
    -->

    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE" />
    <!-- 
    Addresses the challenge of monitoring the network state to ensure that automated operations can run without interruption.
    This permission helps in determining if the device is connected to the internet before attempting any network operations.
    -->

    <uses-permission android:name="android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE" />
    <!-- 
    Overcomes the limitation of storing logs and user data locally to provide better user management and performance tracking.
    This permission allows the application to write essential files that enhance troubleshooting and data management capabilities.
    -->

    <application
        android:allowBackup="true"
        android:icon="@mipmap/ic_launcher"
        android:label="TikTok auto comment software - Android Automation Tool"
        android:roundIcon="@mipmap/ic_launcher_round"
        android:supportsRtl="true"
        android:theme="@style/AppTheme">

        <!-- 
        Registering the MainActivity is essential for any Android application as it acts as the entry point.
        This component addresses the problem of user interaction by presenting the main interface for the automation tool.
        -->
        <activity android:name=".MainActivity">
            <intent-filter>
                <action android:name="android.intent.action.MAIN" />
                <category android:name="android.intent.category.LAUNCHER" />
            </intent-filter>
        </activity>

        <!-- 
        The AutomationService is crucial for running background operations that automate comment management.
        This component directly solves the problem of continuous operation by allowing scheduled tasks to run 24/7,
        which is a key feature of the MadHub platform.
        -->
        <service android:name=".AutomationService"
            android:exported="false" />
        
    </application>
</manifest>
```

### Explanation
- This `AndroidManifest.xml` file effectively addresses the requirements for an automation tool designed for TikTok management by carefully selecting permissions that enhance functionality, ensuring smooth user interactions through the main activity, and enabling automated operations through the registered service. Each comment clearly articulates the problem and how the solution implemented in the manifest file addresses these concerns in line with MadHub's capabilities and the Android platform's requirements.
